    "updated_at": "2026-11-19T18:11:35Z",
    "body": "The work needs changes in camcraft-ui and camcraft-app.\nThe issue requires the display choice to use the existing saved view settings.\ncrates/app/src/view.rs defines ViewPrefs and saves show_gizmo_names.\ncrates/ui/src/state_view.rs loads and saves that structure.\nThe fix must extend that structure and its old-file and round-trip tests.\nIt must also change the renderer, Browser controls, picking, and wasm callers.\n\nRaised effort:medium to effort:high under the work-issue escalation rule.\nNo claim, branch, code change, or test run exists for this attempt.\n\nThe local upstream/main reference is 744c0847. It still defines only two display modes.\nThe existing feature picker sorts cursor distance first and camera depth second.\nThe see-through mode can use its existing through option.\n\nPR #2786 changes browser(), which also contains the display controls.\nA future worker must check that PR and stack if it remains open and eligible.\nPRs #2783 and #2662 also touch viewport_bar.rs.\nCheck their changed functions before the toolbar update.\nOther same-file overlaps include #2773, #2770, #2764, #2763, #2737, #2678, #2663, #2554, and #2149.\n",
